From 5c6b709802e8f8d7d7181a7790a3174485c4b8b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Quinn <theqntbr+git@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 02:28:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] server: a Bun PTY adapter, picked when the server runs on Bun

node-pty loads under Bun but never delivers data or exit events, so the
terminal drawer stayed blank. BunPtyAdapter implements the same PtyAdapter
contract on Bun.spawn({ terminal }): no native addon, no spawn-helper.
server.ts picks it when `Bun` is defined; Node keeps NodePtyAdapter.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
